## Verdict

I agree with the post-mortem: an operator action caused the stop, and solution 1 is the right recovery.
Step 0494 was review-green and passed all 28 verify gates. The supervisor then refused the commit because the executability receipt binds ASG's validator sources, and the ASG checkout was fast-forwarded in the middle of the run.

